        { id: "Sistem pelatihan baru Ikusei Shuro (育成就労) dijadwalkan mulai April 2027. Aturan peralihan bisa berubah, jadi cek info resmi.", en: "The new Ikusei Shuro (育成就労) training system is scheduled to start in April 2027. Transition rules may change, so check official information." }
